    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math><br /><br />Replace <math><mi>x</mi></math> by <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>, we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math><br /><br />From <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mn>3</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Therefore <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math xm